<h1>Omni Online</h1>

<p>
<i>Omni Online</i> puts up one novella-length piece of short 
fiction every month. Many of the works are too large to be 
read with the AOL text viewer, but all of the pieces are
archived, and can be downloaded and read at the user's convenience.

<i>Omni Online</i> is available only through <i>America Online</i>.
Some of the stories are now starting to show up on the new 
[<a href="http://www.omnimag.com">Omni Webpage</a>].
